A team of financial advisors has left Ameriprise Financial to launch their own wealth management practice on NewEdge Advisors’ platform. NewEdge Advisors, one of two registered investment advisor practices in the NewEdge Capital Group, announced Tuesday it had brought on the 14-person team, Seven Bridges Wealth Advisors, in White Plains, N.Y.&nbsp;

